 634:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * Read one block of PCM, convert every frame to one 8-bit unsigned sample
 635:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * for VDAC8 (MSB of each channel, stereo mixed to mono), fill inactive buffer.
 636:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
 637:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   Format         block_align  bytes/block (SOUND_BUFFER_SIZE = 1024)
 638:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   8-bit  mono         1          1024   (no conversion)
 639:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   16-bit mono         2          2048
 640:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   24-bit mono         3          3072
 641:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   stereo           2 x mono   2 x mono   (L+R averaged)
 642:source\asw/mp3.c ****  */
